01:05:49.080 --> 01:05:54.080
Rule 1, your code should only display one message.

01:05:54.080 --> 01:05:58.080
The message that your code displays will depend on the other five rules.

01:05:58.080 --> 01:06:05.080
For rules 2 to 6, the higher numbered rules, take precedence over the lower numbered rules.

01:06:05.080 --> 01:06:14.080
Rule 2, if the user's subscription will expire in 10 days or less, display the message your subscription will expire soon.

01:06:14.080 --> 01:06:16.080
Renew now.

01:06:16.080 --> 01:06:27.080
Rule 3, if the user's subscription will expire in 5 days or less, display the messages your subscription expires in underscore days.

01:06:27.080 --> 01:06:30.080
