01:06:30.080 --> 01:06:42.080
Note, be sure to replace the underscore character displayed in the message above with the value stored in the variable days until expiration when you construct your message output.

01:06:42.080 --> 01:06:51.080
Rule 4, if the user's subscription will expire in one day, display the messages your subscription expires within a day.

01:06:51.080 --> 01:06:54.080
Renew now and save 20%.

01:06:54.080 --> 01:07:01.080
Rule 5, if the user's subscription has expired, display the message your subscription has expired.

01:07:01.080 --> 01:07:09.080
Rule 6, if the user's subscription doesn't expire in 10 days or less, display nothing.

01:07:09.080 --> 01:07:12.080
